flowchart LR
    R[Requester] --> H[Aide & Support]
    H --> MT[Mes tickets]
    H --> CT[Créer un ticket]
    MT --> RT[Ticket]
    CT --> RT
    RT --> OV[Vue d'ensemble]
    RT --> CO[Conversation]
    RT --> AT[Pièces jointes]
    RT --> HI[Historique visible]

    S[Support] --> DB[Tableau de bord]
    S --> TK[Tickets]
    TK --> Q[File d'attente]
    TK --> MY[Mes tickets]
    Q --> ST[Support Ticket]
    MY --> ST
    ST --> SO[Vue d'ensemble]
    ST --> SC[Conversation]
    ST --> IN[Notes internes]
    ST --> CX[Contexte autorisé]
    ST --> SL[SLA]
    ST --> AU[Historique / Audit]

    AUTH[Authorization] -. controls .-> RT
    AUTH -. controls .-> ST
